{"id": "DfQ_9OTx2Is", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Chaalis saal woh uske paas baith ke patthar ki pankhudiyan chhaantti rahi… aaj usne aakhri phool uske liye jada 🤍\n\nAgra ka ek boodha kaarigar, khidki ke paar Taj. Chaalis saal uski biwi bench ke paas baith ke rang-rang ki pankhudiyan apni peetal ki katoriyon mein sajaati thi.\nJis din uski katori gir ke bikhar gayi, usne har ek pankhudi waise hi uthayi jaise woh uthaati thi… aur safed sang-e-marmar mein ek-ek karke jad di.\nAakhri patthar uski naak ki laung ka tha. Usne woh phool ke beech mein lagaya, jo uski khaali gaddi tak jaata hai.\n\n🎵 Barson Ke Intezar Ka · Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan\n\nUsko bhejo jiske pyaar ko tum patthar mein jad dena chahte ho 🤍\n\nBarson Ke Intezar Ka | Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan | Agra | Taj Mahal | sang-e-marmar | pachchikari | uski yaad | qawwali\n\n#NusratFatehAliKhan #Agra #SangeMarmar", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793679573, "like_count": 6254, "comment_count": 9, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2064187170812409a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.463, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNyLZpNnYKMP7vb8HrbGfekgVhDu58685aUaAEH459NXZ6GUmrVjNQz29eizEfj1hNSMXhu8IgXt7j7x9cOafgmapJIw6wJFYpA8bw.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdrCEUgkYUZmlgtJOxGy7B04CBgYWtmozsmdgNj518uy5SG82FuFAD40XnprSyCMJ_QUka-KMcgJ6II93AsJfmk_&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=t7b2QevgaKcQ7kNvwELnjvZ&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=F1VTpngUHchfG5EWAKbfcQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSij28FRjFAWUsZvImF44sHWVTnuEtlxlJPS7jECgm7QQ&oe=6AF447E2", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.463, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agen